{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50623","headline":"河上寄故人 · 韩翃","name":"河上寄故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河流杳霭晓天，濮水黯澹秋烟。\n日暖昆吾台上，春深颛顼城边。\n莺声乱鸣鸿塞，花片细点龙泉。\n西望情人早至，尤应得醉芳年。\n（按《全唐诗》卷二百四十五有此诗。\n惟前半残缺不可句读。\n此见《永乐大典》卷三○○五「九真」「人」字〖五函四十二册〗。\n完整可读，故录存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}